      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent has just refreshed its website with the Fall 2026 collection, introducing a new Niki Soft bag in soft lambskin that carries on the classic black-and-gold palette and the hobo silhouette. The Sac De Jour line adds a Boston bag, its compact, rounded form accented with a metal padlock for an elegant, tailored look.",
