      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Niki Soft Lambskin Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Niki Soft is crafted from supple, smooth lambskin, replacing the signature V-quilting with a clean, solid-color surface for a minimalist, edgy black-and-gold aesthetic. The bag features a main compartment, a front pocket, and a back slip pocket, keeping things organized and sharp. The deep backdrop highlights the iconic YSL Cassandre logo, while the sliding strap—a mix of leather and chain—offers shoulder or crossbody wear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
