      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Sac De Jour Boston mini bag measures 19x13x7cm, with tubular leather handles and an arched top that give it an architectural feel. The leather-wrapped metal padlock is engraved with a delicate YSL Cassandre logo, subtly echoing the gold foil stamp at the opening. It comes in three versions: wine and black Box calfskin, plus a rose lizard skin option. The detachable, adjustable shoulder strap allows for multiple carrying styles.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
