    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The LE 5 À 7 Bea bag now comes in a Baby size, made from soft, lightweight deerskin with a matching suede lining. An internal metal hook lets you adjust the bag's width, and the front YSL Cassandre clasp secures the closure. The classic deerskin version is available in five colors: black, coffee, caramel, light cumin, and light beige. There are also versions in caramel cognac suede calfskin and leopard-print pony-effect leather, offering a warm, tactile feel that's perfect for fall.",
