    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The LE 5 À 7 large shoulder bag is crafted from soft, fine-grained leather with a matching suede lining. The YSL Cassandre leather tab adds a refined touch, while an interior detachable zip pouch keeps essentials organized. Its minimalist silhouette and generous capacity make it a polished, versatile choice, especially for commuters. Available in a range of rich colors—urban gray, dust gray, fox, coffee, legion red, and black—these are timeless, long-lasting options that never go out of style.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
